    /// If the assertion function is imported, the rule will check if they are imported from:
    /// - `"chai"`
    /// - `"node:assert"`
    /// - `"node:assert/strict"`
    /// - `"bun:test"`
    /// - `"vitest"`
    /// - Deno assertion module URL
    ///
    /// Check the [options](#options) if you need to change the defaults.
    ///
    /// ## Examples
    ///
    /// ### Invalid
    ///
    /// ```js,expect_diagnostic
    /// describe("describe", () => {
